sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant E as Editor (BFF)
    participant F as FastAPI RAG
    participant Emb as GeminiEmbedder
    participant VS as PgvectorStore
    participant L as Gemini LLM
    participant DB as Database

    E->>F: POST /api/ai/citation {claim, projectId}
    F->>Emb: embedQuery(claim)
    Note over Emb: taskType = RETRIEVAL_QUERY
    Emb->>L: embedContent API
    L-->>Emb: query vector (3072-dim)
    F->>VS: retrieve(query, projectId, k=5)
    VS->>VS: cosine ANN over HNSW index
    VS-->>F: top-5 chunks + similarity
    F->>F: max_similarity < floor?
    alt weak grounding
        Note over F: Verdict forced to<br/>insufficient_evidence<br/>regardless of LLM
        F-->>E: insufficient_evidence
    else sufficient grounding
        F->>L: classify verdict (evidence-only prompt)
        L-->>F: verdict label
        F-->>E: verdict + cited excerpts
    end
    F->>DB: persist InterventionEvidence per chunk
    E-->>E: show emerald underline + verdict + View evidence
